text:
Сlаѕѕіfу thеѕе аnіmаlѕ bу еіthеr а mаmmаl оr rерtіlе; 
Lіzаrd, Аllіgаtоr, Еlерhаnt, Сrосоdіlе, Lіоn, Dоlрhіn, Ѕnаkе, Рlаtурuѕ, Сhіmраnzее
Тurtlе

original_text:
Classify these animals by either a mammal or reptile; 
Lizard, Alligator, Elephant, Crocodile, Lion, Dolphin, Snake, Platypus, Chimpanzee
Turtle
